Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: memory: factorise LPDDR channel binding into
 SDRAM channel
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

commit 6ab3581ab19fa348b93c85a793e45cd8a80912a8 upstream.

LPDDR, DDR and so SDRAM channels exist and share the same properties, they
have a compatible, ranks, and an io-width.

